  (text "NFC VOUT isolated from SYS/BAT/+3V3. No assumed RF-powered full device.\nFP/LCD/CTAP NFC require charged battery and device ON.\nRF region: tuned coil only, no cell, metal shield or ground planes.\nMobile management needs authenticated APDUs and native OS integration.\nPhone biometrics or a tap never replace device fingerprint verification."
